    "A prompt is the spec you give the model. Strong prompts include a <b>role</b> (who the model is acting as), <b>context</b> (background and data), the <b>task</b>, <b>constraints</b> (tone, length, what not to do) and the <b>output format</b>. Treat it like a product brief: a vague brief gets a vague result.",
