    "There are three main pricing models, often combined. <b>Seat-based</b> pricing (sometimes with a paid AI add-on) is simple for buyers but risky when usage varies a lot. <b>Usage-based</b> pricing (credits, per task) aligns price with cost but makes spend less predictable. <b>Outcome-based</b> pricing (per resolved ticket, per qualified lead) aligns price with customer value, but needs outcomes that are measurable and clearly caused by your product.",
